    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Set behind electric security gates amidst approximately 7 acres of beautifully manicured grounds, Rockford Manor is an exclusive and secure gated development situated on Stradbrook Road. Built by Sorohan Developments, this mature and well-established development comprises a pleasant mix of houses and apartments set within attractive communal grounds. No. 4 is a light-filled three-bedroom end-of-terrace home extending to approximately 90 sq m / 969 sq ft. The property offers well-proportioned accommodation and a particularly private sunny west-facing rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall leading to a bright living room with box bay window overlooking the communal gardens, while to the rear is a well-appointed Shaker-style kitchen with tiled splash back, integrated appliances and double French doors opening onto the private rear garden. Upstairs are two generous double bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from an en-suite, a single bedroom and family bathroom, while a staircase leads to the converted attic. The landscaped rear garden features a sandstone patio, grass lawn and wired storage shed, providing a lovely private outdoor setting.\r\n\r\nRockford Manor offers residents peace, privacy and security while remaining within easy reach of Blackrock, Monkstown and Dun Laoghaire. The area is renowned for its excellent selection of cafés, restaurants and local amenities, with Seapoint DART station and the coastline within walking distance. There are excellent transport links via the 46A and No. 4 bus routes, with easy access to the N11 and Dublin city centre. The area is also well served by an excellent selection of schools, including CBC Junior and Senior School, Rockford Manor, Holly Park, Blackrock College, Newpark Comprehensive School, St Andrew’s College and Loreto Foxrock.\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\r\n•\t3 BED END OF TERRACE RESIDENCE\r\n•\tAPPROXIMATELY 90 SQM/ 969 SQ.FT\r\n•\tBUILT CIRCA 2000\r\n•\tB ENERGY RATING\r\n•\tDOUBLE GLAZED WINDOWS THROUGHOUT\r\n•\tGFCH\r\n•\tCONVERTED ATTIC\r\n•\tFIBRE BROADBAND\r\n•\tCARPETS, BLINDS AND LIGHT FITTINGS INCLUDED\r\n•\tWEST FACING LOW MAINTENANCE REAR GARDEN WITH SIDE PASSAGE ACCESS\r\n•\tCOMMUNAL OFF STREET PARKING\r\n•\tMANAGEMENT FEE/SERVICE CHARGE APPROXIMATELY €906 PER ANNUM\r\n•\tWELL MAINTAINED COMMUNAL GROUNDS\r\n•\tSECURE ELECTRONIC GATED DEVELOPMENT WITH INTERCOM\r\n•\tCLOSE TO SCHOOLS, SPORTS AND RECREATIONAL AMENITIES AND PUBLIC TRANSPORT\r\n\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\n\r\nGROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALL\r\nSemi solid Walnut floor, ceiling light, intercom, burglar alarm, radiator and electrical points.\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM\r\n(6.02m x 3.67m - widest points) features an attractive semi-solid walnut flooring, a marble fireplace with gas inset and a custom-made built-in storage unit with shelving. A bay window with recessed lighting fills the room with natural light, complemented by ceiling lighting and coving. Additional features include a radiator, curtains, fitted roller blind, TV point, fibre connection and ample electrical points.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM\r\n(4.68m x 3.92m - widest points) The dining area features attractive semi-solid walnut flooring, a radiator and double doors opening directly onto the rear garden. The adjoining kitchen is fitted with a comprehensive range of cream Shaker-style wall and floor units, complemented by wooden worktops, a peninsula, Belfast sink and partially tiled splash back. The kitchen is well equipped with a Whirlpool oven and microwave, Electrolux fridge freezer, induction hob and Belling extractor hood. Both areas benefit from ceiling coving, while the kitchen features recessed lighting.\r\n\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\n\r\nLANDING\r\nLaminate floor, hot press and stairs to attic.\r\n\r\nMAIN BEDROOM\r\n(3.71m x 3.33m - widest points) double bedroom to the front with built in wardrobes, ceiling light, curtains, fitted roller blind, radiator and electrical points.\r\n\r\nEN SUITE\r\n(2.84m x 1.26m) part tiled walls and floor, recessed lighting, lit wall mounted medicine cabinet with mirror, large shower with overhead rain attachment, W.C., W.H.B. with under sink storage, extractor fan and chrome heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2\r\n(3.51m x 2.62m - widest points) double bedroom overlooking the rear garden with laminate flooring, ceiling light, built in wardrobes, curtains, fitted roller blind, radiator and electrical points.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3\r\n(2.60m x 2.00m - widest points) single bedroom overlooking the rear garden with laminate flooring, ceiling light, built in wardrobes, picture shelves, curtains, fitted roller blind, radiator and electrical points.\r\n\r\nMAIN FAMILY BATHROOM\r\n(2.73m x 2.01m - widest points) part tiled walls and flooring, ceiling light, lit wall mounted medicine cabinet with mirror, bath with shower attachment, W.C., W.H.B., and radiator.\r\n\r\n\r\nATTIC\r\n(4.78m x 3.62m - widest points) carpet floor, three Velux windows, electrical points and eves storage.\r\n\r\n\r\nREAR GARDEN\r\nThe sunny, west-facing rear garden is private, low maintenance and thoughtfully landscaped, featuring a paved sandstone patio, small lawn and two mature trees providing a lovely backdrop at the end of the garden. A gravelled pathway with tiled steps and mature planting leads from the patio to a garden shed with electricity, while convenient side passage access further enhances the practicality of the space.\r\n\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER\r\nAll information, measurements, floor plans, and details contained in this brochure are for guidance and identification purposes only. While every care is taken in compiling these particulars, the estate agent does not test any appliances, services, or equipment included and cannot verify their condition or working order. Floor plans are illustrative only and are not to scale; they should not be relied upon for purchase decisions. Prospective purchasers are advised to carry out their own investigations and satisfy themselves as to all matters relating to the property."
      },
